  "busesTab": {
    "rules": [
      "The index is built from /campus (`stops`, `routes`, `destinations`): every service, then every stop.",
      "Services: one per key of `routes`, sorted by code in plain string order (code units, not locale). kind \"service\", code and label the service code. (`detail`, shown under it, is \"Loop from <first stop>\" for a loop or \"<first stop> to <last stop>\", with stops by their long names; it is never searched.)",
      "Stops: one per entry of `stops`, in /campus order. kind \"stop\", code the stop's code, label its longName (its name when there is no longName), aliases its name lower-cased followed by the aliases of the /campus destination of kind \"stop\" with the same code (none when there is no such destination). Aliases of other kinds are not used.",
      "Then rank(index, query) with the rules above.",
      "An empty query (after trimming) shows the suggestions: every service, in index order, not limited."
    ],
